 "在目标地点召唤一列烈焰骷髅弓手。", "description_en": "Summons a row of Burning Skeleton Archers in the target location.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["range", "count", "spawn_interval", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "clinkz_wind_walk", "name_zh": "克林克兹·骨隐步", "name_en": "Skeleton Walk", "description_zh": "克林克兹进入隐身状态，移动可以穿过其他单位，攻击或使用物品时现形。脱离隐身后会产生骷髅弓手。骷髅弓手不能移动，需要多次英雄或防御塔攻击才会被击杀。骷髅弓手继承克林克兹一定百分比的攻击力，对建筑造成的伤害降低%skeleton_building_damage_reduction%%%。攻击距离与克林克兹相同。", "description_en": "Clinkz moves invisibly through units until the moment he attacks or uses items. Leaving Skeleton Walk creates Skeleton Archers.Skeleton Archers are immobile and die within multiple attacks from a hero or tower. Skeleton Archers deal a percentage of Clinkz' damage, and deal %skeleton_building_damage_reduction%%% less damage to buildings. Attack range is equal to Clinkz' attack range.", "notes_zh": ["渐隐时间为%fade_time%秒。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "fade_time", "move_speed_bonus_pct", "skeleton_count", "skeleton_offset", "skeleton_offset_min", "skeleton_duration", "skeleton_health", "skeleton_health_tooltip", "skeleton_building_damage_reduction", "attack_rate", "damage_percent", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "clinkz_infernal_shred", "name_zh": "克林克兹·地狱之裂", "name_en": "Infernal Shred", "description_zh": "克林克兹和他的骷髅弓手会施加一个可叠加的负面效果，使他们的攻击可以穿透最高目标%max_armor_piercing_pct%%%总物理护甲（不会降低他们的护甲）。克林克兹每次攻击施加%hero_stacks%%%，骷髅弓手施加%skeleton_stacks%%%。持续%duration%秒。", "description_en": "Clinkz and his skeletons apply a stacking debuff that causes their attacks to pierce up to %max_armor_piercing_pct%%% of the target's total physical armor (does not reduce their armor).  Clinkz applies %hero_stacks%%% per attack, and skeletons apply %skeleton_stacks%%%. Lasts %duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["duration", "hero_stacks", "skeleton_stacks", "max_armor_piercing_pct"]}, {"subject": "omniknight_purification", "name_zh": "全能骑士·洗礼", "name_en": "Purification", "description_zh": "立即治疗一个友方单位，并对周围的敌军造成伤害。", "description_en": "Instantly heals a friendly unit and damages all nearby enemy units.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "%recast_delay%秒延迟后目标会再次受到%recast_effectiveness_pct%%%威力的洗礼。", "en": "After a %recast_delay%s delay, the target is Purified again with %recast_effectiveness_pct%%% effectiveness."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["heal", "radius", "recast_delay", "recast_effectiveness_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "omniknight_martyr", "name_zh": "全能骑士·驱逐", "name_en": "Repel", "description_zh": "提供减益免疫状态和%magic_resist%%%魔法抗性，以及额外生命恢复。", "description_en": "Grants Debuff Immunity with %magic_resist%%% magic resistance, as well as bonus HP Regen.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["base_hpregen", "duration", "magic_resist", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "omniknight_hammer_of_purity", "name_zh": "全能骑士·纯洁之锤", "name_en": "Hammer of Purity", "description_zh": "全能骑士将神圣之力注入他的战锤，使他的攻击距离提升，会根据基础攻击力的一定百分比造成纯粹伤害，并且使目标短时间内被减速。全能骑士会在%heal_duration%秒内回复%heal_pct%%%造成的伤害。", "description_en": "Omniknight imbues his hammer with holy power, causing his attack to have increased range, deal pure damage based on a percentage of his base damage and slow his target for a short duration. Omniknight heals for %heal_pct%%% of the damage dealt over %heal_duration%s.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["base_damage", "bonus_damage", "heal_pct", "heal_duration", "total_ticks", "attack_cooldown", "attack_range_bonus", "duration", "movement_slow", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "omniknight_degen_aura", "name_zh": "全能骑士·退化光环", "name_en": "Degen Aura", "description_zh": "削弱过于靠近的敌方单位的移动能力，降低其移动速度。", "description_en": "Degenerates the movement capabilities of enemy units that stray too near, slowing their movement speed.", "notes_zh": ["对减益免疫单位无效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["speed_bonus", "radius", "linger_duration"]}, {"subject": "omniknight_guardian_angel", "name_zh": "全能骑士·守护天使", "name_en": "Guardian Angel", "description_zh": "全能骑士召唤出守护天使，使全能骑士附近的所有友方单位对物理伤害免疫。", "description_en": "Omniknight calls upon a Guardian Angel that grants immunity from physical damage to all allied units near Omniknight.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "守护天使的作用范围为全地图，影响建筑并增强生命回复。", "en": "Guardian Angel has global radius, affects buildings, and amplifies health restoration."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "radius", "is_global", "affects_buildings", "heal_and_regen_amp", "model_scale", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "enchantress_impetus", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·推进", "name_en": "Impetus", "description_zh": "激活后每次攻击都有附魔效果，根据与目标的距离造成额外伤害。目标越远，伤害越高。对幻象造成双倍伤害。", "description_en": "Places an enchantment on each attack while activated, causing it to deal additional damage based on how far away the target is.  The farther the target, the greater the damage dealt. Deals double damage to illusions.", "notes_zh": ["造成伤害上限的距离是%distance_cap%。", "计算与目标之间的距离在攻击弹道击中目标时。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["distance_damage_pct", "distance_cap", "illusion_damage_multiplier", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "enchantress_enchant", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·魅惑", "name_en": "Enchant", "description_zh": "魅惑魔女诱惑一个敌人。如果目标是英雄，将被驱散，其移动速度也会被减缓，持续%slow_duration%秒，而魅惑魔女和她的单位攻击目标时拥有额外攻击距离。\n\n如果目标是非英雄单位，魅惑魔女会将其控制，并获得%xp_gain_pct%%%相应的击杀经验。魅惑魔女控制的非英雄单位最多持续%dominate_duration%秒。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Enchantress charms an enemy. If the enemy is a hero, they are dispelled and slowed for %slow_duration%s, and Enchantress and her units gain bonus attack range against the target.\n\n If the enemy is a creep, she brings it under her control and receives %xp_gain_pct%%% of their experience bounty.  Enchantress can control creeps for up to %dominate_duration%s. \n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["可以转化幻象。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "魅惑魔女可以同时控制多个非英雄单位。", "en": "Enchantress can control multiple creeps at a time."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["slow_movement_speed", "slow_duration", "attack_range_bonus", "dominate_duration", "enchant_health", "enchant_damage", "xp_gain_pct", "level_req", "max_creeps", "bonus_armor", "bonus_health", "bonus_damage", "bonus_attackspeed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint"]}, {"subject": "enchantress_natures_attendants", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·自然之助", "name_en": "Nature's Attendants", "description_zh": "召唤一群小精灵治疗魅惑魔女以及身边的友方单位。", "description_en": "A cloud of wisps heals Enchantress and any friendly units nearby.", "notes_zh": ["不会选择满血单位进行治疗。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["heal_duration", "heal_interval", "heal", "radius", "wisp_count", "movespeed", "total_max_heal", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "enchantress_bunny_hop", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·跃动", "name_en": "Sproink", "description_zh": "向后跳跃，躲避多种飞行过程中的攻击和技能弹道，并向魅惑魔女的攻击距离+%bonus_attack_range%范围内最远的%attack_targets%个敌方单位发动一次附有推进的攻击。", "description_en": "Leaps backward, dodges incoming projectiles, and launches an Impetus attack on the %attack_targets% furthest enemy units within Enchantress' attack range + %bonus_attack_range%.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["hop_distance", "hop_duration", "hop_height", "attack_targets", "bonus_attack_range", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "enchantress_little_friends", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·密友", "name_en": "Little Friends", "description_zh": "魅惑魔女缠绕一个敌方单位。目标附近所有敌方、友方和中立非英雄单位会攻击魅惑魔女选定的目标，并且具有攻击速度和移动速度加成，持续%duration%秒。", "description_en": "Enchantress roots an enemy unit. All creeps, ally, enemy and neutral within a radius will gain bonus movement and attack speed and attack the chosen target for %duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "bonus_attack_speed", "bonus_move_speed", "radius", "root_base_duration", "root_per_target", "max_root", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "enchantress_untouchable", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·不可侵犯", "name_en": "Untouchable", "description_zh": "魅惑魔女让她的敌人神魂颠倒，受到他们攻击时会降低其攻击速度。", "description_en": "Enchantress beguiles her enemies, slowing their attacks when she is attacked.", "notes_zh": ["所有直接攻击魅惑魔女的敌方单位都会被减速。", "减速效果在攻击单位产生攻击动作时出现，而不是伤害生效时。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["slow_attack_speed", "slow_duration"]}, {"subject": "enchantress_rabblerouser", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·煽动野怪", "name_en": "Rabble-Rouser", "description_zh": "魅惑魔女使所有中立生物和魅惑魔女控制下的单位对敌方英雄造成额外伤害。", "description_en": "Enchantress causes neutral creeps or any unit under her control to deal additional damage to enemy Heroes.", "notes_zh": ["不会影响劝化的中立生物、痛苦魔方和肉山。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage_amp"]}, {"subject": "huskar_inner_fire", "name_zh": "哈斯卡·心炎", "name_en": "Inner Fire", "description_zh": "在炽烈的狂暴下将附近所有敌人击退至固定距离外，造成伤害和沉默。", "description_en": "In a fiery rage, knocks all nearby enemies away from you to a fixed distance, dealing damage and silencing them.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["health_cost", "damage", "radius", "disarm_duration", "knockback_distance", "min_knockback_distance", "knockback_duration", "min_knockback_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "huskar_burning_spear", "name_zh": "哈斯卡·沸血之矛", "name_en": "Burning Spear", "description_zh": "哈斯卡将其长矛点燃，在普通攻击的同时对敌方单位造成持续伤害。多次攻击会造成持续伤害叠加。每次攻击都将牺牲哈斯卡部分生命值。", "description_en": "Huskar sets his spears aflame, dealing damage over time with his regular attack.  Multiple attacks will stack additional damage.  Each attack drains some of Huskar's health.", "notes_zh": ["沸血之矛在多次施放到目标身上效果可以叠加。没有叠加上限。", "哈斯卡不能使用此技能自杀。", "炙矛可热不会对肉山造成额外的最大生命值烧灼伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_health_cost", "burn_damage", "burn_damage_max_pct", "duration", "AbilityCastRange"]}, {"subject": "huskar_berserkers_blood", "name_zh": "哈斯卡·狂战士之血", "name_en": "Berserker's Blood", "description_zh": "哈斯卡的伤痛赐予他力量，根据他损失的生命值将获得攻击速度、魔法抗性和生命恢复加成。生命恢复为力量的一定百分比。", "description_en": "Huskar's injuries feed his power, giving increased attack speed, magic resistance and health regen based on missing health. Health regen is a percentage of your strength.", "notes_zh": ["加成效果为线性增加，满血时没有加成，%hp_threshold_max%%%生命时达到最大加成。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "哈斯卡可以消耗一定生命来主动开启狂战士之血，炙疗哈斯卡。进行驱散，然后在一定延迟后回复消耗的生命，并且每驱散一个负面状态，他就会额外回复生命。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "en": "Huskar can activate Berserker's Blood for a health cost to cauterize himself. Dispels Huskar, then after a delay, heals for the amount of health consumed plus an additional bonus per debuff dispelled.DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel"}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["maximum_attack_speed", "maximum_health_regen", "maximum_magic_resist", "hp_threshold_max", "activatable", "activation_healthcost_pct", "activation_cooldown", "activation_delay", "activation_heal_pct_per_debuff"]}, {"subject": "huskar_blood_magic", "name_zh": "哈斯卡·血魔法", "name_en": "Blood Magic", "description_zh": "哈斯卡没有魔法值。物品的魔法消耗会转换为生命消耗。哈斯卡的生命消耗为魔法伤害，可以被魔法抗性减少。", "description_en": "Huskar does not have mana. Mana costs of items are converted into health costs.Huskar's Health Costs are Magical Damage and can be reduced by Magic Resist.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": []}, {"subject": "huskar_life_break", "name_zh": "哈斯卡·牺牲", "name_en": "Life Break", "description_zh": "哈斯卡牺牲自己的生命来摧毁敌人的生命，他跃向一个目标，造成目标当前生命值一定百分比的伤害，并且降低目标的移动和攻击速度。哈斯卡在跳跃过程中为减益免疫，并且魔法抗性提升%immunity_resist%%%。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Huskar draws upon his health to break an enemy's life, leaping at a target to shatter a percentage of that hero's current health and slow both their movement and attack speed.  While leaping, Huskar is Debuff Immune with %immunity_resist%%% magic resistance.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["如果哈斯卡在跳跃时受到控制技能，或目标在0.015秒内移动1400码以上，跳跃就会停止。", "减速效果无视减益免疫。", "牺牲无法被躲避。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "强迫敌方目标攻击哈斯卡，并提升施法距离。", "en": "Forces the enemy target to attack Huskar and increases cast range."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["health_cost_percent", "health_damage", "charge_speed", "tooltip_health_damage", "tooltip_health_cost_percent", "movespeed", "attack_speed", "slow_duration_tooltip", "taunt_duration", "cast_range_bonus", "immunity_resist", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "night_stalker_void", "name_zh": "暗夜魔王·虚空", "name_en": "Void", "description_zh": "制造一个伤害性的虚空，对一个敌方单位造成减速及伤害。夜晚时虚空可以造成短暂眩晕，打断持续施法，并且效果的持续时间更长。", "description_en": "Creates a damaging void that slows an enemy unit and deals damage. At night, Void also mini-stuns, interrupting channeling abilities, and its effects lasts longer.", "notes_zh": ["虚空在白天不会对敌人造成眩晕。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "虚空现在影响目标范围内所有单位。", "en": "Void now affects all units in a radius around the target."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "duration_day", "duration_night", "movespeed_slow", "attackspeed_slow", "invisible_damage_pers", "invisible_damage_tickrate", "max_level", "max_level_tooltip", "cast_radius", "cast_radius_tooltip", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "night_stalker_crippling_fear", "name_zh": "暗夜魔王·伤残恐惧", "name_en": "Crippling Fear", "description_zh": "暗夜魔王恐吓附近所有敌人，使他们在他身边时被沉默，并受到伤害。效果在夜晚持续更久。", "description_en": "Night Stalker horrifies all nearby enemies, causing them to become silenced and take damage over time while near him.  The effect lasts longer at night.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration_day", "duration_night", "mana_interval", "radius", "dps", "tick_rate", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}]
